Overall Number of Baseline Participants only included the Modified Intent to Treat (MITT) population:

* 266 subjects were randomized to Rolapitant and 266 were randomized to control;
* 264 of those randomized to Rolapitant received study drug in Cycle 1; 262 of those who were randomized to control received study drug in Cycle 1.
